THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
======================

Maia networks (maia-1100 / 1300 / 1500 / 1700 / 1900)
  CSSLab, University of Toronto -- https://github.com/CSSLab/maia-chess
  GPL-3.0. Weights are fetched by tools/export_maia.py, not vendored in this
  repository, and are embedded in the released APK.

  Reference: McIlroy-Young, Sen, Kleinberg, Anderson. "Aligning Superhuman AI
  with Human Behavior: Chess as a Model System." KDD 2020.

Leela Chess Zero (lc0)
  https://github.com/LeelaChessZero/lc0 -- GPL-3.0
  Used at build time only, via its `leela2onnx` mode, to convert the Maia
  weights to ONNX. Not linked into the app.

chesslib
  Ben-Hur Carlos Vieira Langoni Junior -- https://github.com/bhlangonijr/chesslib
  Apache-2.0. Move generation, FEN parsing, board representation.

ONNX Runtime
  Microsoft -- https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
  MIT. On-device inference.

Jetpack Compose, AndroidX
  Google -- Apache-2.0.
